  "highlights": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "value": "<p>Want to study at a TEF Gold-rated institution located in the heart of England? Then the University of Derby is your ideal choice. Here, you can choose from a diverse range of undergraduate and postgraduate programmes across various disciplines, including Business, Engineering, Health Sciences, Fine Arts, and Humanities.</p><p>Moreover, the university is ranked 2nd in the UK for Course Quality and Employability (Uni Compare Ranking 2026), top 7 in the UK for International Students (WhatUni 2026), and Best University Housing in the UK and Ireland (2022–2024).</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Student Life",
      "value": "<p>You’ll have a vibrant student life at the University of Derby. You can join many clubs and societies, and participate in sports and wellness programmes. Moreover, Derby’s Student Services team offers you mental health support, financial advice, and much more.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Accommodation",
      "value": "<p>The University of Derby offers you award-winning accommodation. You have several options available for undergraduate and postgraduate levels, located close to the campus. You can choose between en-suite and shared rooms, depending on your preferences.</p><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><i>Additionally, if you’re looking for budget-friendly accommodation options outside the campus, feel free to </i><a href=\"https://edvoy.com/app/\"><i>download our app</i></a><i> and check out the Stays feature!</i></p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    },
    {
      "title": "Facilities",
      "value": "<p><strong>Library</strong><br>You’ll find the university’s main library at the Kedleston Road campus, providing many resources for your research and study. It offers quiet study areas, computer labs, and a vast collection of digital and print materials.</p><p><strong>Sports</strong><br>Derby is rated as one of the top 50 sports universities in the UK. You can choose from over 30 sports clubs to join, and the university also offers a range of gym and fitness facilities. You can also access several other facilities through their Sports Centre membership and 'UoD Active' programme.</p><p><strong>Laboratory</strong><br>At the University of Derby, you’ll find several labs and facilities for teaching and research, including dedicated areas for electrical and electronics, computing, forensics, and biomedical sciences.</p><p><strong>Cafeteria</strong><br>At the university, you’ll find Blends Coffee Shop, which is the University of Derby Students' Union's flagship cafe. It offers you a full menu of hot drinks, hot food, cakes and bakes.</p>",
      "image": null,
      "highlightType": "General"
    }
